{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_bdrk_jl4lqseo2ayrte376joary22rg2byevgb4dah76ci3fu6ul67mhq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I've scaffolded a complete ExC Shell Hello World app on disk.\n\n**What I built**\n\n- **`actions/hello/index.js`** — a web action following the standard boilerplate: `Core.Logger`, extracts the IMS token (returns 401 if absent), greets `params.name` (defaults to \"World\"), and always returns `{ statusCode, body }` with 500 on unexpected errors.\n- **`app.config.yaml`** — standalone app with the action correctly under `application.runtimeManifest` (never at root), `runtime: nodejs:22`, and `require-adobe-auth: true` so ExC Shell injects the token.\n- **`web-src/src/components/App.js`** — a React Spectrum UI (default export) with a `TextField`, an accent `Button` with `isPending`, and positive/negative `InlineAlert` states. It reads the action URL from `config.json` by its exact name (`actions['hello']`) and calls it with `Authorization` + `x-gw-ims-org-id` headers. Gracefully warns instead of throwing when the URL is empty pre-deploy.\n- **`web-src/src/index.js`** + **`index.html`** + **`exc-runtime.js`** — the standard ExC Shell bootstrap wiring (script tag present, `runtime.done()` called only in the `ready` handler, verbatim exc-runtime).\n- **`web-src/src/config.json`** — empty `{}`; the CLI/sandbox fills action URLs at deploy/preview time.\n- **`test/hello.test.js`** — covers 200 (with and without a name), 401 (missing token), and 500 (SDK failure).\n- Config files: `package.json` (single root), `.babelrc`, `.eslintrc.json`, `.env-sample`.\n\n**Next steps**\n\n```bash\nnpm install\naio app use          # select org/project/workspace\nnpm test             # run the action tests\naio app deploy       # build + deploy; writes action URLs into config.json\n```\n\nWant me to add a second action, wire in the State SDK for persistence, or turn this into an extension project instead of standalone?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5814,"cache_read_input_tokens":28793,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5814,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9b4cb0dd-7297-44af-a386-5e92a1431228","uuid":"1b6b62b0-5430-44dc-85fd-485160282fa7","timestamp":"2026-09-29T06:08:16.641Z"}
